      "cooked": "<p>Got a question.&nbsp; I could see this both ways.&nbsp; Her power is:<br><br>Matron of Magic</p><p>The first time a (green hand) or (purple ankh) card is put into the villain trash each turn, this card deals the hero with the most cards in play 2 Infernal Damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So if a green hand is put in the villain trash, then later same villain turn, a purple ankh is put in, does it trigger a second time?&nbsp; Or has it already been fulfilled so it doesn't?</p>",
